# Development builds only: release builds embed the application ID from ORBIS_MSA_CLIENT_ID
# (secrets.env or a CI secret; see secrets.env.example) and ignore this file.
# Copy to /data/orbis-jdk/launcher/microsoft-auth.properties on the console.
# Register your own Microsoft public application that is approved for Minecraft/Xbox access.
# Configure it for personal Microsoft accounts and enable public client/device code flows.
# The launcher uses the consumers tenant and requests XboxLive.signin offline_access.
# Device code sign-in uses no client secret. Leave this example blank until configured.
client_id=
